he browser.\n\n**Tests:**\n- `bash .theseus/oracle/unit.sh`: 178 passed, 1 skipped.\n- `sdkjs-word.sh`: 42/42 suites passed (6195 assertions).\n- `theseus validate`: 0 errors, 1 warning.\n\n**What changed:**\n- **`CollaborativeEditing.js`:** after remote changes are applied, it records which objects they touched (each object once) and hands that list to `pre_Save` once, then clears it.\n- **`api.js` (`pre_Save`):** when that list is waiting, it only adds fonts from those objects. Otherwise (open, save, images) it does the full document walk as before.\n- **`DrawingDocument.js`:** a new `CheckFontNeedsIncremental` adds the new names to `logicDocument.Fonts`. It never removes a font, so the set can only grow and no glyphs go missing.\n- **`Document.js`:** a new `GetFontNamesFromClasses` only reads font names from objects it knows hold text: paragraphs, tables, content controls and runs, plus theme fonts. Any other kind of object (styles, numbering, sections, theme, drawings) falls back to the full walk.\n\n**Decisions:**\n- The fast path only runs once the document has finished loading and already has a font list, so changes applied while a document opens still get the full walk.\n- `Run.js` is not changed: the cost goes away because the whole-document loop is no longer called on every remote change.\n\n**Surprise:** the packet says the change list (`m_aChanges`) carries each object's class. It doesn't — it only holds binary data. The objects only exist after the changes are applied, in `CoHistory`, between `m_nRecalcIndexStart` and `m_nRecalcIndexEnd`.\n\n**Not done:** the before/after profile on the 100-page docx and the browser check of a remote change. Both are in the follow-up PKT-0071, which was spawned in the first attempt.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas:**\n- In word, the changed objects are reached through `CoHistory` after apply, not through `m_aChanges`.\n- Commits on local branches of `external/sdkjs` may not survive between attempts, so check `git -C external/sdkjs log` before relying on earlier work.\n\nThe Executor log, the lessons and my friction line are committed in this repo as `151f8a0`.","ttft_ms":1797,"type":"result","duration_ms":168524,"uuid":"eca792fd-0247-4a60-82c5-b68250247d4a","ttft_stream_ms":858,"time_to_request_ms":297,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":5,"system_prompt":144,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":6,"input_attachments":27,"input_hooks":4,"conversation_append":2,"transcript_persist":23,"tool_pool_refresh":1,"init_message":10,"init_frame_send":6,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":6,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":12,"query_setup":3,"auto_mode_context_wait":9,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":21,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":3,"request_build":8},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":53,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":180,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":213,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":140,"process_rss_mib_result":235,"process_anon_mib_result":142,"process_peak_rss_mib":285,"process_cpu_ms_turn":10228,"process_wall_ms_turn":168524,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":1348,"process_wall_ms_streaming":42946,"main_stream_count":13,"main_stream_event_count":1017,"main_stream_chunk_count":728,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"artifact_opening_prefetch","slowest_producer_ms":11,"cpu_ms":27,"major_faults":0,"setup_ms":1,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":11,"ambient_wait_ms":10,"render_ms":2,"producers":41,"token_counts":0},"first_content_frame_ms":858,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":4395868,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"flag_fetch_kick":"started_in_init_warm","time_origin_ms":1793663091317.2961,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"process_start_tuning":0}
